    "created_at": "2016-04-26T17:43:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-26T17:43:02Z",
    "body": "I think we can close this, because there's nothing for the spec to do here; it already allows the desired flexibility, and it's simply up to browsers to decide if they want to work on their `<input type=\"number\">` or `<input inputmode=\"numeric\">` implementations to behave with the UX @AshleyScirra describes. Feel free to refer to this thread when filing feature requests on browser issue trackers!\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
